{"id":"sueldo","lemma":"sueldo","pos":"noun","rank":2299,"glosses":["salary, wage","any of several historical European units of currency, including the solidus, sol, and soldo, typically worth twelve dineros, or one-twentieth of a libra"],"ipa":"/ˈsweldo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"sueldos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-sueldo.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Quién te paga el sueldo?","en":"Who pays your salary?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455185","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"payment"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"¿Puedes vivir de tu sueldo?","en":"Can you get by on your wages?","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to live"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Han aumentado los sueldos.","en":"Salaries have increased.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/512868","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to increase, grow","l":"aumentar"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Ayer recibí mi sueldo.","en":"I got my pay yesterday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/462134","words":[{"g":"yesterday"},{"g":"to receive, get","l":"recibir"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Estoy satisfecho con mi sueldo.","en":"I'm satisfied with my salary.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/764936","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"satisfied"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"my"},null]}]}